sequenceDiagram
  actor Rv as Reviewer
  actor P as Producer
  participant FC as FeedbackController
  participant FS as FeedbackService
  participant RS as RenderService
  participant PC as PublishController
  participant PS as PublishService
  Rv->>FC: POST /scripts/{id}/approve-video (note)
  FC->>FS: approveVideo(id, reviewer, note)
  FS->>FS: IN_QA, count open notes of current clip
  alt open notes remain
    FS-->>FC: 400 Resolve the open review notes
  else no open notes
    FS->>FS: Video APPROVED, recordReview
    FS->>RS: renderApproved(id) if no MP4 yet
  end
  P->>PC: POST /scripts/{id}/publish (targets)
  PC->>PS: publish(id, req, producer)
  alt YOUTUBE target
    PS-->>PC: 503 not configured
  else INTERNAL_LIBRARY and LMS
    PS->>PS: Save Publication, LMS embed code, PublishRecord
    PS-->>PC: PublishResponse(embedCode), video PUBLISHED
  end
